  "details": "I want to write tools and behaviors that take into account the max player capacity of a world dynamically. Currently we have to cache a value and make sure it matches the number shown on the website, but I want this value to be accessible via script, for more flexible automated stuff that I am working on.\n\nEx. If a world has a max capacity of 32 players, I can call GetMaxCapacity() and it returns 32.\n\nIdeally this can be called in Udon but even a non-realtime version would be better than nothing.\n\nAn editor-only version could be something like VRC.SDKBase.Editor.GetWorldMaxCapacity()",
